{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测Windows经隐藏Run键持久化。对应需求：持久化。官方：Persistence via Hidden Run Key Detected。","from":"now-9m","index":["logs-endpoint.events.registry-*","winlogbeat-*","logs-windows.sysmon_operational-*","endgame-*","logs-crowdstrike.fdr*","logs-sentinel_one_cloud_funnel.*","logs-m365_defender.event-*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Windows经隐藏Run键持久化","references":["https://github.com/outflanknl/SharpHide","https://github.com/ewhitehats/InvisiblePersistence/blob/master/InvisibleRegValues_Whitepaper.pdf"],"risk_score":73,"rule_id":"a9b05c3b-b304-4bf9-970d-acdfaef2944c","severity":"high","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 持久化","来源: 默认","对应需求: 持久化"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"registry where host.os.type == \"windows\" and event.type == \"change\" and length(registry.data.strings) > 0 and\n  \n  /* Registry Path ends with backslash */\n  registry.path : \"*\\\\Run\\\\\" and\n  registry.path : (\n    \"*\\\\Software\\\\Microsoft\\\\Windows\\\\CurrentVersion\\\\Run\\\\\",\n    \"*\\\\Software\\\\WOW6432Node\\\\Microsoft\\\\Windows\\\\CurrentVersion\\\\Run\\\\\",\n    \"*\\\\Software\\\\Microsoft\\\\Windows\\\\CurrentVersion\\\\Policies\\\\Explorer\\\\Run\\\\\"\n  )\n","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nWindows经隐藏Run键持久化\n\n### 为何重要\n在重启或登录后保持立足点\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 Windows 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件/注册表或安全日志）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","event.action","event.code","file.path","registry.path","source.ip","destination.ip","message"]},"threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1547","name":"Boot or Logon Autostart Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1547/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1547.001","name":"Registry Run Keys / Startup Folder","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1547/001/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0003","name":"Persistence","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0003/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1106","name":"Native API","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1106/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0002","name":"Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0002/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1112","name":"Modify Registry","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1112/"},{"id":"T1564","name":"Hide Artifacts","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1564/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0005","name":"Defense Evasion","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0005/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"},{"package":"windows","version":"*"},{"package":"crowdstrike","version":"*"},{"package":"sentinel_one_cloud_funnel","version":"*"},{"package":"m365_defender","version":"*"}],"version":217,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
